{"seq":3,"slug":"mev-transaction-ordering","title":"MEV 与交易排序经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/defi-protocols/mev-transaction-ordering","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"mev-与交易排序经济学\">MEV 与交易排序经济学</h1><p>区块链中每个区块的交易排列顺序不是随机的——它是一个隐含的拍卖结果。谁控制排序权，谁就能从信息不对称中提取价值。这种价值被称为最大可提取价值（Maximal Extractable Value, MEV），它揭示了区块生产过程中一个根本性的权力结构问题：区块空间是稀缺资源，排序权是定价权，定价权意味着从用户到验证者的价值转移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>MEV（Maximal Extractable Value）</strong>：区块生产者通过策略性排序交易可获得的最大额外利润</li>\n<li><strong>三明治攻击（Sandwich Attack）</strong>：在用户交易前后分别插入买入/卖出交易提取滑点价值</li>\n<li><strong>PBS（Proposer-Builder Separation）</strong>：将区块提议权和构建权分离的架构设计</li>\n<li><strong>订单流拍卖（OFA）</strong>：交易被发送到私有通道进行竞价，部分 MEV 返还用户</li>\n<li><strong>ePBS</strong>：将 PBS 写入协议层的以太坊升级方案（EIP-7732）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"mev-的经济学定义\">MEV 的经济学定义</h2><p>MEV 的形式化定义：在给定一组待处理交易的情况下，区块生产者通过策略性地包含、排除或重排交易所能获得的最大额外利润（超出基础区块奖励和标准手续费）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MEV = max_{\\sigma \\in \\Sigma}[V(\\sigma)] - V(\\sigma_{default})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是交易排列方式，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是所有可能的排列集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(\\sigma)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该排列下区块生产者的总价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{default}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按 gas 价格排序的默认排列。</p>\n<p>截至 2026 年，以太坊上累计被提取的 MEV 超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext>亿。月度</mtext><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>V</mi><mtext>提取量约</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40 亿。月度 MEV 提取量约</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">亿。月度</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">提取量约</span></span></span></span></span>2400 万（主要通过三明治攻击和套利），但实际 MEV「可用量」远大于被执行量——约 80% 的 DeFi 交易已转移到私有内存池。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>MEV 策略</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>对用户的影响</th>\n<th>占比(2026)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DEX 套利</td>\n<td>跨池/跨交易所价格差异套利</td>\n<td>中性（改善价格一致性）</td>\n<td>~45%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清算</td>\n<td>抢先执行 DeFi 清算获取罚金</td>\n<td>低害（维护系统偿付能力）</td>\n<td>~20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三明治攻击</td>\n<td>在用户交易前后插入交易</td>\n<td>高害（直接从用户提取价值）</td>\n<td>~25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JIT 流动性</td>\n<td>大交易前临时注入/撤出流动性</td>\n<td>中等（稀释常驻 LP 收益）</td>\n<td>~10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"区块生产供应链-pbs-架构\">区块生产供应链：PBS 架构</h2><p>以太坊 PoS 后的区块生产形成了一条分工供应链（Proposer-Builder Separation）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[用户交易] --&gt; B[公共内存池]&#10;    A --&gt; C[私有 RPC&lt;br/&gt;Flashbots Protect&lt;br/&gt;MEV-Blocker]&#10;    B --&gt; D[搜索者&lt;br/&gt;Searchers]&#10;    C --&gt; E[订单流拍卖&lt;br/&gt;OFA]&#10;    D --&gt; F[区块构建者&lt;br/&gt;Builders]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[中继&lt;br/&gt;Relays]&#10;    G --&gt; H[区块提议者&lt;br/&gt;Validators]&#10;    H --&gt; I[最终区块]\">graph LR\n    A[用户交易] --&gt; B[公共内存池]\n    A --&gt; C[私有 RPC&lt;br/&gt;Flashbots Protect&lt;br/&gt;MEV-Blocker]\n    B --&gt; D[搜索者&lt;br/&gt;Searchers]\n    C --&gt; E[订单流拍卖&lt;br/&gt;OFA]\n    D --&gt; F[区块构建者&lt;br/&gt;Builders]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[中继&lt;br/&gt;Relays]\n    G --&gt; H[区块提议者&lt;br/&gt;Validators]\n    H --&gt; I[最终区块]</pre><p>每个环节的经济角色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>搜索者</strong>：发现 MEV 机会，构建交易 bundle，向构建者出价</li>\n<li><strong>构建者</strong>：聚合搜索者的 bundle，组装最高价值的完整区块</li>\n<li><strong>中继</strong>：可信中介，验证区块有效性，防止提议者窃取 MEV</li>\n<li><strong>提议者（验证者）</strong>：选择出价最高的区块头签名，获取竞标支付</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2025 年数据显示，超过 90% 的以太坊区块通过 MEV-Boost 构建。前两大构建者（Titan Builder ~46.5%、Beaverbuild ~9.4%）加上 Rsync (~15.6%) 和 Flashbots (~12.8%) 控制了约 85% 的区块构建——这种集中度（HHI ≈ 3892）远超传统反垄断标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三明治攻击的博弈分析\">三明治攻击的博弈分析</h2><p>三明治攻击是最典型的用户侵害型 MEV。其经济结构：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>攻击者观察到用户以滑点容忍度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 提交的 AMM 交易</li>\n<li><strong>前跑交易</strong>：攻击者先于用户买入，推高价格</li>\n<li><strong>用户交易</strong>：用户以更差的价格成交（但仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 容忍范围内）</li>\n<li><strong>后跑交易</strong>：攻击者卖出获利</li>\n</ol>\n<p>攻击者利润 ≈ 用户承受的额外滑点 - gas 成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Profit_{sandwich} = \\Delta P_{user} \\cdot Q_{user} - 2 \\cdot gas_{priority}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用户的最优防御策略是设置最小滑点容忍度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>δ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：太低则交易频繁失败，太高则给攻击者留出利润空间。这是一个典型的攻防博弈均衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mev-缓解方案的经济比较\">MEV 缓解方案的经济比较</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>经济效果</th>\n<th>信任假设</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Flashbots Protect</td>\n<td>私有提交，不进公共内存池</td>\n<td>防前跑，但信任构建者不泄露</td>\n<td>信任中继和构建者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MEV-Blocker</td>\n<td>私有 + 90% 回溯收益返还用户</td>\n<td>用户获得部分 MEV 回流</td>\n<td>信任 OFA 拍卖公正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CoW Swap</td>\n<td>批量拍卖，统一结算价格</td>\n<td>消除排序优势（同价同时成交）</td>\n<td>信任求解器竞争充分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BuilderNet</td>\n<td>TEE 环境中去中心化构建</td>\n<td>降低单一构建者的审查能力</td>\n<td>信任 TEE 硬件安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ePBS (EIP-7732)</td>\n<td>协议原生 PBS，消除中继</td>\n<td>消除中继信任，降低 MEV 集中</td>\n<td>仅信任协议规则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"glamsterdam-升级与-epbs-的经济影响\">Glamsterdam 升级与 ePBS 的经济影响</h2><p>以太坊计划于 2026 年下半年通过 Glamsterdam 升级实施 ePBS（Enshrined Proposer-Builder Separation，EIP-7732）。核心变化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>区块构建者提交密封竞标（仅含区块哈希和支付金额）</li>\n<li>提议者选择最高出价并签名，无需看到交易内容</li>\n<li>新的「载荷及时性委员会」（PTC）验证构建者是否按时揭示区块</li>\n</ul>\n<p>经济影响预估：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>中继变得多余</strong>：信任直接由协议层强制执行</li>\n<li><strong>构建者竞争可能加剧</strong>：进入门槛降低，因为不再需要与特定中继建立关系</li>\n<li><strong>审查能力弱化</strong>：目前约 30% 的中继区块是 OFAC 合规的（曾高达 72%），ePBS 移除了中继这一天然审查执行点</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"mev-作为区块链的-隐性税\">MEV 作为区块链的「隐性税」</h2><p>从宏观经济角度，MEV 是所有链上用户承担的隐性交易成本。用户的真实交易成本不只是 gas fee：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">True\\_Cost = Gas\\_Fee + Slippage + MEV\\_Extraction</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对普通用户而言，MEV 提取可能远超显式 gas 费。一笔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mtext>的</mtext><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>X</mi><mtext>交易在高波动时可能承受</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10,000 的 DEX 交易在高波动时可能承受</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">交易在高波动时可能承受</span></span></span></span></span>50-200 的三明治攻击损失——这是「使用公共区块链的税」。</p>\n<p>MEV 的存在从根本上挑战了区块链「无中介」的叙事：虽然没有银行作为中介，但搜索者-构建者-提议者组成的供应链在功能上扮演了类似角色——只是从显性佣金变为隐性的排序寻租。</p>\n<p>这种「隐性税」与 <a href=\"amm-liquidity-pool\">AMM 的流动性成本</a> 共同构成了 DeFi 用户的完整摩擦成本结构。而 MEV 收入在验证者和构建者之间的分配，直接影响了 <a href=\"../foundations/mining-staking-economics\">挖矿与质押经济学</a> 中讨论的验证者收益模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>MEV 是区块链排序权产生的经济租金——只要交易有序且区块空间有限，排序权就有价值。当前 MEV 生态高度集中（前 4 个构建者控制 &gt;85% 区块），ePBS 试图通过协议层原生的竞价机制打破中继寡头。对用户而言，MEV 是使用公共区块链的隐性税，私有交易通道和批量拍卖是当前最有效的缓解方案，但都引入了新的信任假设。MEV 不会消失——它是有序交易系统的数学必然，问题在于谁捕获它、以什么规则分配。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MEV 与交易排序经济学","id":"mev-与交易排序经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MEV 的经济学定义","id":"mev-的经济学定义"},{"level":2,"text":"区块生产供应链：PBS 架构","id":"区块生产供应链-pbs-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"三明治攻击的博弈分析","id":"三明治攻击的博弈分析"},{"level":2,"text":"MEV 缓解方案的经济比较","id":"mev-缓解方案的经济比较"},{"level":2,"text":"Glamsterdam 升级与 ePBS 的经济影响","id":"glamsterdam-升级与-epbs-的经济影响"},{"level":2,"text":"MEV 作为区块链的「隐性税」","id":"mev-作为区块链的-隐性税"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"借贷协议经济模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/defi-protocols/lending-borrowing-protocols"},"next":{"title":"加密市场微观结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/crypto-market-microstructure"}}